<given-names>BP</given-names></name><name><surname>Fox</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Wong</surname><given-names>DL</given-names></name><name><surname>Meerman</surname><given-names>HJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Pucci</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Fong</surname><given-names>RB</given-names></name><name><surname>Heng</surname><given-names>MH</given-names></name><name><surname>Tsurushita</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Gieswein</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Park</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Characterization of humanized antibodies secreted by <italic>Aspergillus niger</italic></article-title><source>Appl Environ Microbiol</source><year>2004</year><volume>70</volume><fpage>2567</fpage><lpage>2576</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15128505</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1128/AEM.70.5.2567-2576.2004</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ward</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Wilson</surname><given-names>LJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Kodama</surname><given-names>KH</given-names></name><name><surname>Rey</surname><given-names>MW</given-names></name><name><surname>Berka</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Improved production of chymosin in <italic>Aspergillus </italic>by expression as a glucoamylase-chymosin fusion</article-title><source>Bio/Technology</source><year>1990</year><volume>8</volume><fpage>435</fpage><lpage>440</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1366537</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/nbt0590-435</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ward</surname><given-names>M</given-na